  "notes": [
    "**Ofrecer** is an -ER verb with irregular \"yo\" form in present",
    "Present: irregular \"yo\" form (ofrezco) with spelling change c→zc before o",
    "Preterite: regular -ER endings",
    "Imperfect: regular -ER pattern",
    "Pretérito Perfecto: regular past participle **ofrecido**",
    "Future: regular future endings attached to infinitive",
    "Condicional: regular conditional endings attached to infinitive",
    "Same conjugation pattern as **parecer**, **crecer**, **conocer**, and **desaparecer**",
    "Common usage: *ofrecer ayuda* (to offer help), *ofrecer un servicio* (to provide a service), *ofrecer disculpas* (to offer apologies)",
    "Often used reflexively: **ofrecerse** (to volunteer, to offer oneself)",
    "Related noun: **la oferta** (offer, sale)"
  ],
